# Wave T33 (Steamspring kit): terracefloor — the hot spring's
# terrace ring. PALE MINERAL TERRACE: broad smooth slabs in
# warm pale stone, rust-tinted joints, white crust patches and
# a faint turquoise mineral stain at the slab edges — the
# crust a hot spring lays down. Unlike Lastlight's veined
# marble (cool white, fine veins), Blossom's inlay slabs
# (petal motif), Fairhaven's running-bond quay stone.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T33-STEAMSPRING-PLAN.md §5.)
